    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0000",
      "start": 0.66,
      "end": 6.26,
      "text": "Cost review for the transrail platform, we are 22% above budget.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.633
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0001",
      "start": 6.26,
      "end": 14.06,
      "text": "The biggest line is Kafka storage, the train position topic alone is 4TB, with 7 days of retention.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.633
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0002",
      "start": 14.06,
      "end": 22.26,
      "text": "I checked with operations, they never replay more than 2 days, 7 days was a habit from the old platform.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.633
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0003",
      "start": 22.26,
      "end": 30.46,
      "text": "So we reduce the Kafka retention from 7 days to 3 days, that keeps a safety margin over the 2 days they actually use.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.179,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005,
      "compression_ratio": 1.633
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0004",
      "start": 30.46,
      "end": 33.46,
      "text": "That cuts storage by more than half.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.089,
      "compression_ratio": 1.485
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0005",
      "start": 33.46,
      "end": 38.46,
      "text": "Second saving, move the bridge and the consumers to gravitan instances.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.089,
      "compression_ratio": 1.485
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0006",
      "start": 38.46,
      "end": 43.46,
      "text": "Our tests show about 20% lower compute cost for the same load.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.089,
      "compression_ratio": 1.485
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0007",
      "start": 43.46,
      "end": 47.46,
      "text": "Do it, and to be clear, the region does not change.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.089,
      "compression_ratio": 1.485
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0008",
      "start": 47.46,
      "end": 55.46,
      "text": "We stay in Paris, EU West 3, someone asked about Ireland because it is cheaper, but the data must stay in France.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.089,
      "compression_ratio": 1.485
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0009",
      "start": 55.46,
      "end": 62.08,
      "text": "Last point, Deployments, Production Deployments go out on Thursday morning, after the weekly",
      "avg_logprob": -0.334,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.032,
      "compression_ratio": 1.272
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0010",
      "start": 62.08,
      "end": 63.96,
      "text": "change board.",
      "avg_logprob": -0.334,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.032,
      "compression_ratio": 1.272
    },
    {
      "id": "transrail-03-cost-review#0011",
